0..78 Comment "//! A match of no arm over a path whose endpoints hold variables. The naturals"
79..159 Comment "//! are free: no rule rewrites a term, so two terms whose first difference, read"
160..231 Comment "//! side by side, is two distinct constructors are apart whatever their"
232..307 Comment "//! variables hold. That is the unifier\'s conflict rule, disjointness under"
308..323 Comment "//! injectivity"
324..423 Comment "//! [Cockx-2018-proofrelevant_unification_dependent_pattern_matching_only_axioms_your_type_theory]."
424..497 Comment "//! A presented type\'s open endpoints are refused, in `absurd-not-apart`."
498..501 Comment "//!"
502..609 Comment "//! - cites: [Cockx-2018-proofrelevant_unification_dependent_pattern_matching_only_axioms_your_type_theory]"
